{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05877","headline":"华岳 · 王维","name":"华岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岳出浮云，积雪在太清。\n连天凝黛色，百里遥青冥。\n白日爲之寒，森沈华阴城。\n昔闻乾坤闭，造化生巨灵。\n右足踏方止，左手推削成。\n天地忽开拆，大河注东溟。\n遂爲西峙岳，雄雄镇秦京。\n大君包覆载，至德被羣生。\n上帝伫昭告，金天思奉迎。\n人只望幸久，何独禅云亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}